odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:23403:•style – With the style:family 19.480 attribute, the style:name attribute uniquely identifies a style. The <office:styles> 3.15.2, <office:automatic-styles> 3.15.3 and <office:master-styles> 3.15.4 elements each shall not contain two styles with the same family and the same name. 
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:23587:If a parent style is not specified, the default style which has the same style:family 19.480 attribute value as the current style is used.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:23801:19.520 style:vertical-align
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:23803:The style:vertical-align attribute specifies how to vertically align a line in a columned area. The value of this attribute can be either top, middle, or bottom.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:23805:The defined values for the style:vertical-align attribute are:
