odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37511:The fo:border attribute is usable with the following elements: <style:graphic-properties> 17.21, <style:header-footer-properties> 17.5, <style:page-layout-properties> 17.2, <style:paragraph-properties> 17.6 and <style:table-cell-properties> 17.18.
odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:37513:The fo:border attribute has the data type string 18.2.
